WEBVTT

00:04:59.852 --> 00:05:04.195
ambao unatumia njia zilizopitwa na wakati

00:05:04.195 --> 00:05:06.233
utakuwa majibu chanya ya uongo,

00:05:06.233 --> 00:05:09.659
kukufanya ufikirie kwamba umejiandaa

00:05:09.659 --> 00:05:11.799
kuliko vile ulivyo.

00:05:11.799 --> 00:05:15.692
Uongozi katika karne ya 21 unaelezwa

00:05:15.692 --> 00:05:18.846
na kushuhudiwa na maswali matatu.

00:05:18.846 --> 00:05:20.180
Wapi unaangalia

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:23.256
kutabiri mabadiliko yanayofata

00:05:23.256 --> 00:05:26.729
katika mfumo wa biashara wa maisha yako?

00:05:26.729 --> 00:05:31.579
Jibu la hili swali lipo katika kalenda yako.